                "value": null
              },
              "content": "{A想象}还记得吗？我们相识，\n开始于星海之中，\n一次偶然的、启发灵感的下午茶。",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_203107101_3163804577_content",
