                "textId": "Performance_203107101_3163804578_fakeName",
                "value": null
              },
              "content": "从那次以后，每次和你在一起，\n即使遇到麻烦，最后事情也总能蓬~松松，\n完美解决！",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_203107101_3163804578_content",
                "value": "从那次以后，每次和你在一起，\n即使遇到麻烦，最后事情也总能蓬~松松，\n完美解决！"
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": null,
              "textGuid": 3163804578
