                "textId": "Performance_203107101_3163804579_fakeName",
                "value": null
              },
              "content": "所以，我想，将这次寻觅玩偶的推理行动，\n也设计成——{短暂停}\n{A两眼放光}推、理、茶、话、会！",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_203107101_3163804579_content",
                "value": "所以，我想，将这次寻觅玩偶的推理行动，\n也设计成——{短暂停}\n{A两眼放光}推、理、茶、话、会！"
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
